Description: Tools for managing and visualizing permanent forest plot data
    collected in the 'ForestPlots.net' field-sheet and Query Library formats
    and in the layout of the Brazilian 'MONITORA' biodiversity monitoring
    program. Functions build interactive 'HTML' plot maps of tagged trees
    with voucher photographs and filters for taxonomy and collection status
    ('forplot_map()'); produce plot- and subplot-level collection-balance
    reports, species checklists and 'Excel' summaries of collection
    completeness ('forplot_balance()'); organize voucher image folders by
    updated identification ('forplot_vouchers()'); fill herbarium label
    spreadsheets such as 'JABOT' and 'BRAHMS' from field data
    ('forplot_sheets()'); and cross-check field determinations against
    specimen records of a 'JABOT' herbarium Darwin Core Archive
    ('forplot_crossdet()').
